  "triggers": [
    {
      "id": "trg_enter_library",
      "label": "进入图书馆",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "enter",
        "location_id": "library",
        "first_time": true
      },
      "visibility": "player_visible",
      "once": true,
      "once_scope": "room",
      "priority": 10,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "id": "att_library_richtext",
          "kind": "richtext",
          "format": "markdown",
          "order": 0,
          "body": "# 图书馆\n\n推门时，雨水的气味跟着你进来。\n\n> “艾琳小姐在里面休息。请尽量不要惊动她。”\n\n你能注意到：\n\n- 高窗只拉开一半，玻璃上全是细长的雨痕；\n- 红木书桌的抽屉半开，夹层里似乎压着东西；\n- 书架后传来轻轻的敲击声。\n\n**这里一定有人。**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trg_clue_diary",
      "label": "读到皮面日记",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "clue",
        "clue_id": "clue_diary"
      },
      "visibility": "player_visible",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 20,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "id": "att_diary_richtext",
          "kind": "richtext",
          "format": "markdown",
          "order": 0,
          "body": "## 皮面日记\n\n最后三页只有反复的句子：\n\n| 日期 | 记录 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 第三天 | 墙里有人在数数，从一数到四。 |\n| 第五天 | 管家又来送饭。他叫我不要出声。 |\n| 第七天 | 数到四之后，墙里安静了一会儿。 |\n\n> “别让钟走到四。”\n\n字迹在这里被水渍晕开。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trg_npc_butler",
      "label": "管家开口",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "npc",
        "npc_id": "npc_butler"
      },
      "visibility": "player_visible",
      "once": true,
      "once_scope": "pc",
      "priority": 30,
      "content": "霍尔特把左手往袖子里缩了缩：“诸位远道而来，先喝口热茶吧。艾琳小姐只是受了点惊。”",
      "attachments": []
    },
    {
      "id": "trg_interaction_altar",
      "label": "读懂祭坛图",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "interaction",
        "location_id": "ritual",
        "object_id": "obj_altar",
        "interaction_id": "interact_altar_study",
        "result": "success"
      },
      "visibility": "player_visible",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 40,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "id": "att_altar_richtext",
          "kind": "richtext",
          "format": "markdown",
          "order": 0,
          "body": "### 祭坛背面\n\n符号汇成一张图：\n\n1. 读过图的人握住银匕首；\n2. 匕首按在祭坛中央；\n3. 祭坛必须已经“就绪”。\n\n> 图样右下角刻着一行小字：“第四次之后，门就不再需要钥匙。”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trg_clock_doom_warning",
      "label": "厄运时钟：第三次",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "clock",
        "clock_id": "doom_clock",
        "gte": 3
      },
      "visibility": "player_visible",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 50,
      "content": "墙里的数数声突然清晰起来：“一、二、三……”",
      "attachments": [
        {
          "id": "att_doom_richtext",
          "kind": "richtext",
          "format": "markdown",
          "order": 0,
          "body": "## 裂隙在回应\n\n你听见墙里有人在数数。\n\n> **“一、二、三……”**\n\n下一次就是四。必须做决定了：封印、离开，或者让它发生。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trg_manual_ritual",
